 "intro_zh": "太昊陵,即“三皇之首”太昊伏羲氏的陵庙,位于河南省淮阳区羲皇故都风景名胜区,毗邻风景秀丽的万亩龙湖,是全国重点文物保护单位,中国十八大名陵之一。",
 "intro_en": "Taihao Mausoleum, the mausoleum of Taihao Fuxi, the \"head of the Three Emperors\", is located in the Xihuang Former Capital Scenic Area in Huaiyang District, Henan Province, adjacent to the scenic 10,000-acre Long Lake. It is a national key cultural relics protection unit and one of the eighteen famous mausoleums in China.",
